  Id: lethal
  DisplayName: Lethal (n)
  RulesText: "This weapon burns flesh or splinters into fragments, causing hideous
    internal injuries. \nA model that suffers wounds from a weapon with the Lethal
    keyword (after applying shields and armour) takes (n) additional wounds (in total,
    not per wound suffered).\nLethal is cumulative. If more than one Lethal modifier
    applies to the attack, add together the (n) values.\n"
  HasValue: 1
  ValueLabel: n
